      "id": "claim_555d9e10539441148d9d2a93bab1f470",
      "statement": "The persistence package enforces a database/schema/role naming convention where local Docker uses <project>_development database with <project> schema and <project>_username role, while Testcontainers uses <project>_testing database with the same schema and role; the schema carries no environment suffix so migrations apply unchanged.",
